        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Night Latch Function Handleset for Global Series TH1100EDTBAR</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Night Latch Function Handleset (turning key opens door) for Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>PDQ 4200 Rim Exit Device</b></a> and other manufactures <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with rim lock cylinder, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Global TH1100-NLED-AL Night Latch  Handleset \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Night Latch - Entry by turning key. Key does NOT unlock panic exit device. Key unlatches the exit device when turned so you can open the door. </li>\r\n<li>Finish: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Height: 14-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with Schlage \"C\" Keyway Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
